#: prefs.js:49
msgid "Nonlinear Animation"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:55
msgid "Animation curve"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:56
msgid ""
"Pick a curve and it applies instantly. Create your own, or share curves as "
"files."
