#: prefs.js:130
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:65
msgid "Interruption continuity"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:131
msgid ""
"Interrupted animations keep their momentum instead of restarting from "
"standstill (e.g. flipping two app-grid pages quickly)."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:137
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:50
msgid "Reversal buffering"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:138
msgid ""
"Recommended on. An interruption into the opposite direction decelerates and "
"rebounds instead of changing direction instantly. Turning it off is only "
"meant for isolating unexpected behavior; you then get the native hard "
"reversal."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:145
msgid "Reversal depth"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:152
msgid "Hard"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:162
msgid "Bouncy"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:171
msgid "Workspace switching"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:172
msgid ""
"Ease the workspace switch animation. Turn off if secondary monitors flicker "
"during switches on multi-monitor fractional-scale setups."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:179
msgid "Spring fidelity"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:180
msgid ""
"How spring curves are solved. Ultra integrates physics every frame: higher "
"fidelity, more CPU."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:183
msgid "Efficient (analytic)"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:184
msgid "Ultra (frame integration)"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:194
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:201
msgid "Ease magic-lamp minimize"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:202
msgid ""
"If compiz-alike-magic-lamp-effect is installed, decelerate its minimize/"
"unminimize into the dock. No-op otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:211
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:212
msgid "Toggles for the deeper interventions, and rarely-touched tuning."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:216
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:116
msgid "Instant overview close"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:217
msgid ""
"A close requested mid-animation reverses the overview immediately instead of "
"finishing its opening first. Turn off if overview open/close misbehaves."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:224
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:80
msgid "Threshold (ms)"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:225
msgid ""
"Only animations ≥ this get eased (hovers ~100ms). Lower = more things eased."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:232
msgid "Gesture grace (ms)"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:233
msgid ""
"After a 3-finger swipe/pinch, animations play native for this long. 0 = ease "
"everything."
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:240
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:92
msgid "Gesture duration scale"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:241
msgid ""
"Stretches gesture commits (workspace switch, paging). The curve stays "
"velocity-matched, so there is no jolt. 1.0 = native."
msgstr ""

